{
  "sn12.52:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 12.52 ",
  "sn12.52:0.2": "6. Dukkhavagga ",
  "sn12.52:0.3": "Upādānasutta ",
  "sn12.52:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṁ viharati. ",
  "sn12.52:1.2": "“Upādāniyesu, bhikkhave, dhammesu assādānupassino viharato taṇhā pavaḍḍhati. ",
  "sn12.52:1.3": "Taṇhāpaccayā upādānaṁ; ",
  "sn12.52:1.4": "upādānapaccayā bhavo; ",
  "sn12.52:1.5": "bhavapaccayā jāti; ",
  "sn12.52:1.6": "jātipaccayā jarāmaraṇaṁ sokaparidevadukkhadomanassupāyāsā sambhavanti. ",
  "sn12.52:1.7": "Evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa samudayo hoti. ",
  "sn12.52:2.1": "Seyyathāpi, bhikkhave, dasannaṁ vā kaṭṭhavāhānaṁ vīsāya vā kaṭṭhavāhānaṁ tiṁsāya vā kaṭṭhavāhānaṁ cattārīsāya vā kaṭṭhavāhānaṁ mahāaggikkhandho jaleyya. ",
  "sn12.52:2.2": "Tatra puriso kālena kālaṁ sukkhāni ceva tiṇāni pakkhipeyya, sukkhāni ca gomayāni pakkhipeyya, sukkhāni ca kaṭṭhāni pakkhipeyya. ",
  "sn12.52:2.3": "Evañhi so, bhikkhave, mahāaggikkhandho tadāhāro tadupādāno ciraṁ dīghamaddhānaṁ jaleyya. ",
  "sn12.52:2.4": "Evameva kho, bhikkhave, upādāniyesu dhammesu assādānupassino viharato taṇhā pavaḍḍhati. ",
  "sn12.52:2.5": "Taṇhāpaccayā upādānaṁ …pe… ",
  "sn12.52:2.6": "evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa samudayo hoti. ",
  "sn12.52:3.1": "Upādāniyesu, bhikkhave, dhammesu ādīnavānupassino viharato taṇhā nirujjhati. ",
  "sn12.52:3.2": "Taṇhānirodhā upādānanirodho; ",
  "sn12.52:3.3":